Homepage: https://github.com/apiplant/phonon-rs
Description: Phonon-2 speech-to-text CLI and dictation daemon (candle) (CUDA build)
 phonon transcribes audio files or the microphone with Phonon-2, the
 five-value quantised Parakeet-TDT-0.6B-v3, natively on candle. phonon-
 dictate (Linux only) is a push-to-talk dictation daemon. The model (164
 MB) is downloaded from Hugging Face on first use into ~/.cache/phonon-
 rs, or taken from --model. This build is linked against CUDA. Needs an
 NVIDIA GPU (Turing or newer). libcuda1 (installed by the NVIDIA driver
 package) satisfies the runtime link; it does not by itself guarantee
 driver/toolkit compatibility.
